        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_6c97de5f4b3d437d9b36a3f40ab69b58",
      "statement": "Session-lifecycle behaviour is verified at two tiers: the mocked unit tier (`unit-tests/session-manager.test.ts`, `unit-tests/session-timeout.test.ts`) can only show that the code agrees with its own model, while `tests/integration/session-manager.integration.test.ts` and `tests/integration/concurrent-session-cap.integration.test.ts` run against real Redis (db 1) to prove the cap holds under a race and that the stored TTL exceeds the configured idle window.",
